              "sendTimedMessage": { "delay": 1500, "message": "Read the share. Four operations, one schedule, one authority. And the Trojan Horse manifest has health-record and dispatch vendors on it, nine days dormant, not ninety. The brief was understated. If you want the team moved, call me while there's still time to do it." }
